Make sessions the single source of truth for timer duration

- Refactor frontend useTaskTimer to calculate totals from sessions array via calculateFromSessions()
- Update backend UpdateTask to derive task.duration from sum of session.duration values
- Fix GORM Save() not persisting Duration by using explicit Updates() calls
- Change backend to use loaded sessions slice instead of database SUM query
- Update GetActiveTask to return all sessions (completed + active)
- Fix column deletion to work for any column with proper index reordering
- Connect ActionBar buttons to task/column creation and hide filter button
- Update all timer tests to provide sessions arrays instead of duration fields
- Add browser refresh debug logging for timer diagnostics
